.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sync 1  "sync " 
.SH NAME
sync \- Sync encrypted sessions to a remote (secret gists)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsync\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Sync encrypted sessions to a remote (secret gists)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sync\-status(1)
Show what push and pull would do, per session
.TP
sync\-push(1)
Upload new and changed sessions (encrypted)
.TP
sync\-pull(1)
Download new and changed sessions
.TP
sync\-delete(1)
Remove sessions from the remote (the local file stays)
.TP
sync\-migrate(1)
Move the per\-session gists of the old layout into packs
.TP
sync\-key(1)
Export or import the sync key
.TP
sync\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
